sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as chef
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant DB as Database

    C->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API-->>C: 200 token (position=Chef)
    C->>API: GET /api/orders?status=Confirmed
    API-->>C: 200 kitchen queue with meal_order lines
    loop for each order line
        C->>API: GET /api/meals/:id/ingredients
        API-->>C: 200 recipe with ingredient stock_quantity
        alt ingredient stock_quantity too low
            C->>API: PATCH /api/meals/:id (availability=unavailable)
            API->>DB: update meals.availability
            API-->>C: 200 meal hidden from menu
        else enough stock
            C->>API: PATCH /api/meal-order/:id (prepared=true)
            API->>DB: mark line prepared
        end
    end
    C->>API: PATCH /api/orders/:id (status=Confirmed, ready_for_service)
    API-->>C: 200 order handed to waiter or delivery
